<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Seu acesso ao Cadterreiros</title>
  <style>
    body, table, td, p, a, li, blockquote {
      -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
      -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;
    }
    table, td {
      mso-table-lspace: 0pt;
      mso-table-rspace: 0pt;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f6f1ea; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;">
  <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%" style="background-color: #f6f1ea;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center" style="padding: 32px 12px;">
        <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="600" style="width: 100%; max-width: 600px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e3d8c8; border-radius: 6px; overflow: hidden;">

          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 28px 32px; background-color: #4b170d;">
              <p style="margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #e2b23c;">
                Cadterreiros · Curadoria
              </p>
              <h1 style="margin: 0; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: normal; color: #ffffff;">
                Seu acesso ao Cadterreiros
              </h1>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 30px 32px;">
              <p style="margin: 0 0 18px 0; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55; color: #2f2a26;">
                Olá, {{ fullname }}.
              </p>

              <p style="margin: 0 0 22px 0; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55; color: #2f2a26;">
                Você foi adicionado à equipe do Cadterreiros com o papel de <strong>{{ role }}</strong>.
              </p>



              <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #2f2a26;">
                Na tela de login, escolha “Primeiro acesso”, informe este e-mail e siga as instruções para definir sua senha.
              </p>

              <p style="margin: 24px 0 0 0; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #2f2a26;">
                Envie sua resposta para o email:
                <a href="mailto:suporte@cciao.org" style="color: #a83a1e; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: bold;">suporte@cciao.org</a>.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 20px 32px; background-color: #faf7f2; border-top: 1px solid #e6ded2;">
              <p style="margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; text-align: center; color: #6b625a;">
                Casa de Cultura Ilê Asé D'Osoguian · Cadterreiros
              </p>
              <p style="margin: 0; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; text-align: center; color: #9b9188;">
                Recenseamento das comunidades de matriz africana da Paraíba
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
